'''Kaoru Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained as a Stamp Reward during the [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 753
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Kaoru Cat
|name2 = Swordscat Kaoru
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Swordscat Kaoru''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Kaoru Cat suffers from having an awkward mix of stats, like a hybrid between a meatshield and a crowd-controller. This means that it isn't great at doing either, having range that is too high to protect melee units like [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Assassin BearCat]], but not high enough to stay safe if the enemies push forward. For this reason, it's better to use either [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], who can just freeze Dark enemies at a higher range, [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]], who has a much more consistent weaken at a higher range, on top of targetting all non-[[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies, or [[Neko Rin (Rare Cat)|Neko Rin]], who has a higher dodge chance, lower recharge time and lower cost. It's also worth noting that Kaoru Cat has [[Single Attack]], which is obviously a poor choice for an anti-[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] unit, since Dark enemies are typically spammed.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & User Rank Dump}}

